      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h3> IT Systems Area </h3> <h1> abas ERP person responsible for support/developer (m/f/d) </h1>",
      "body": "<p><a href=\"/fileadmin/01_Pages/Company/Career/DE/abas_ERPBetreuer_2026_05_07_ZOLLER.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Job Posting (PDF)</a></p>",
