    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h4>Your Profile</h4><ul><li>A successfully completed degree in Computer Science, Business Informatics, or Computer Engineering, or comparable vocational training with professional experience—career changers are also welcome</li><li>Knowledge of ERP systems, document management systems, business processes, and databases</li><li>Programming skills in Java, as well as a willingness to learn additional programming languages</li><li>Good command of German and English</li><li>Service- and customer-oriented</li><li>Ability to work in a team, initiative, and a sense<br/> of responsibility</li></ul><h4>Your Responsibilities</h4><ul><li>Design and development of process solutions within our “abas” ERP system and the ELO document management system</li><li>Development of interfaces to other program modules</li><li>User and application support</li><li>Testing of modules, software, and interfaces</li><li>Maintenance and update of documentation<br/> </li></ul><h4>Location</h4> <p>Pleidelsheim, Germany.</p>",
